test-runs/

# uv lockfile. This project installs with pip (`pip install -e ".[dev]"`; CI and
# the Dockerfile do the same), so a uv.lock here is a stray artifact of running
# uv locally rather than a dependency source of truth. Ignored so it can't be
# committed and start competing with pyproject.toml. If the project ever adopts
# uv properly, drop this line — lockfiles belong in version control.
uv.lock
